 "purpose": "Replace the 8mm ASTK e-read star by eight identical local stages. Local EP read7 edges; request and response forwarding2 each; seven RL3 legs: fixed42 edges. Native EP SRAM bench sustains four reads per edge. Placement next to the actual EP; no dynamic credits or arbitration.",
 "structural_change": "Replace centralized eight-owner mux with owner-local captured request/response insertion; all inputs directly registered and all outputs flops. One physical master with stable captured owner_id strap. No inherited closed views.",
 "slot_change_request": "RTL-BUILD-KV/ASTK 2026-10-18: the inline e-read leaf of qkd_astk_strip_er_st (one per ASTK strip), 86.4 x 47.52, at the strip's row-1/row-2 boundary (owners 0..3 S face, 4..7 N face); W = the V-return read ports + response tags + ck, E = response_data toward the pvw pair (pvw_<p>.ie).  KV-PLAN3 assigns the in-strip site with the re-cut ASTK_W (no tree columns).",
